---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import confPhoto from '../assets/conf-sud-photo.jpg';
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about__inner">
    <p class="about__lede reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
      For the love of the  <em class="serif-italic">game.</em>
    </p>

    <p class="about__body reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
      <strong>At the core of every good fighting game is a robust system,</strong> designed with
      rules to govern player interactions across a near-infinite space of player decisions tuned to
      produce fierce, dynamic competition. As both a gamer and engineer, my favorite systems serve
      complex human needs while remaining elegant, understandable, and maintainable.
    </p>

    <p class="about__body reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 200ms">
      My foundation is in backend, so I think from the data model and contracts outwards, and I build
      full-stack applications now, following my systems end-to-end to meet the needs of real users in
      my community. I've <strong>shipped production code in 5 languages across 6 teams</strong> each
      with different stacks, and I comfortably adapt to apply the right solution for each team and product.
    </p>

    <figure class="about__figure reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 220ms">
      <Image
        src={confPhoto}
        alt="Noah with the fighting game community he runs events for"
        class="about__photo"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption class="about__caption">With the community I build for.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <p class="about__body reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 240ms">
      These days much of my building happens with AI in the loop, and I hold that work to the same
      standard as my own: <strong>I stay the owner of every change that ships</strong> (more on how
      below). When I'm not working, you can find me
      playing fighting games or creating content to teach and grow my community. I love hearing about new
      ideas, so if you're building and want to work together, <a href="#contact">get in touch</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .about__inner {
    max-width: 38rem;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .about__lede {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .about__lede .serif-italic {
    color: var(--color-rust);
    font-size: 0.95em;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about__body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .about__body strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about__body a {
    color: var(--color-rust);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rust);
    transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .about__body a:hover {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  /* Editorial community photo: full-width within the prose column, sits between
     the engineering and personal paragraphs as the pivot from work to human. */
  .about__figure {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.625rem;
  }

  .about__photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }

  .about__caption {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about { padding: 5rem 1.5rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .about { padding: 4rem 1.25rem; }
  }
</style>
